      "name": "Leipoa",
      "rank": "GENUS",
      "commonName": "Malleefowl",
      "description": "A monotypic genus of shy, intricately patterned megapodes that inhabit the arid mallee scrublands of southern Australia. They are renowned for their precisely regulated incubation mounds.",
